  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Train the trainer programme for the TRA. Phase II (2024) (Amsterdam)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Phase II of the &#x201c;Train the Trainers&#x201d; programme conducted at the IBFD Headquarters in Amsterdam, the Netherlands from 18 to 22 March 2024 for 6 officials from the Tanzania Revenue Authority. The study-visit consisted of knowledge sharing activities, presentation skills, online training method, and exposure visits to the NL Ministry of Finance and corporate sector.</narrative>
  </description>
